# The Vercel project's Root Directory is "frontend" -- everything else here
# is Foundry/cargo-stylus/Python tooling irrelevant to that build. Vercel's
# own gitignore-based exclusion doesn't reliably reach nested .gitignore
# files (e.g. contracts-stylus/.gitignore's /target, ~1.8GB of Rust build
# output) when `vercel` is invoked from the repo root instead of frontend/,
# so list the heavy, unrelated directories explicitly.
contracts-stylus/target
contracts/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/snapshots
.venv
__pycache__
data
